# Doc hygiene — on touch

Editing an agent-facing or OKF doc. Before finishing:

- **Product state first:** ship/defer/priority change → update [`docs/agents/product-state.md`](../../docs/agents/product-state.md) before other agent docs.
- **Sweep on touch:** run the canonical staleness sweep and fix stale banners/headers in this same edit.
- **Archive frozen:** do not rewrite `docs/archive/**` bodies.
- **Concept / bundle touch:** when a concept or settled doc changes materially, refresh the folder index (e.g. [`docs/agents/index.md`](../../docs/agents/index.md), [`docs/concepts/index.md`](../../docs/concepts/index.md)) and prepend [`docs/log.md`](../../docs/log.md) in the same pass.

Playbook: [`.cursor/skills/docs-maintenance/SKILL.md`](../../.cursor/skills/docs-maintenance/SKILL.md). Staleness sweep command and fix tiers: [`docs/agents/doc-structure.md`](../../docs/agents/doc-structure.md).
